1
00:00:00,419 --> 00:00:01,759
(Sheldon:)-Hello.
-Hey.

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,090
(Leonard:)You guys didn't break up.

3
00:00:03,155 --> 00:00:07,035
(Sheldon:)No. Sorry to disappoint you,
but Amy pointed out

4
00:00:07,126 --> 00:00:08,936
that you we only trying
to manipulate me.

5
00:00:09,094 --> 00:00:10,194
(Amy:)Which you also
figured out by yourself.

6
00:00:10,295 --> 00:00:12,465
(Sheldon:)Which I also figured out by myself.

7
00:00:14,266 --> 00:00:15,646
(Penny:)Well, I'm glad you're still together.

8
00:00:15,801 --> 00:00:18,541
(Sheldon:)Okay, you can stop trying
to make this about our relationship.

9
00:00:18,704 --> 00:00:21,274
(Amy:)-Which is stronger than ever.
-Which is stronger than ever.

10
00:00:22,141 --> 00:00:24,981
(Sheldon:)This is about you
trying to change my environment,

11
00:00:25,144 --> 00:00:26,884
(Sheldon:)which was perfect the way it was.

12
00:00:27,046 --> 00:00:29,826
(Howard:)But it got the way it was
through change.

13
00:00:29,982 --> 00:00:33,332
(Howard:)The spot that you love to sit in,
that no one else can sit in,

14
00:00:33,485 --> 00:00:37,995
(Howard:)only exists because, despite your
objections, I bought this couch.

15
00:00:38,123 --> 00:00:43,003
(Howard:)Me. So explain why that change
was bad and this change was good.

16
00:00:45,064 --> 00:00:46,474
(Penny:)Um....

17
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:49,243
(Amy:)You don't need to
explain yourself to him.

18
00:00:49,401 --> 00:00:51,641
(Sheldon:)I don't need to explain
myself to you!

19
00:00:52,738 --> 00:00:54,908
(Amy:)You're sick of his nonsense
and ready to move in with me.

20
00:00:55,074 --> 00:01:03,024
Keep the table!
We don't use that space!

